&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Field and Corporate Marketing to drive attendance at regional marketing events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend field marketing events to engage with participants, identify opportunities, and schedule meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a mentor for new BDR hires in helping them navigate their key accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Digital Marketing to develop targeted marketing tactics against your assigned target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share innovative ideas and collaborate with the team to continuously refine BDR strategies and drive measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
