&lt;li&gt;Positive and energetic phone skills, excellent listening skills, and strong writing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with a track record of successful, credible achievements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of business process, roles, and organizational structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in developing Enterprise and Mid-Market business in Australia&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated persistence in meeting or exceeding targets through consistent follow-up, effective objection handling, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated interest in GitLab and the DevOps space, such as staying current on GitLab releases or industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in using Salesforce (incl. Salesforce reporting) and LinkedIn. Proficiency in other prospecting tools (Zoominfo, Cognism, Outreach, 6Sense, etc.) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous tech industry experience; experience in sales development, marketing, and/or sales; and outbound prospecting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
